     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: StructureDefinition EHDSECGAlgorithm</b></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder0\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"The logical name of the element\">Name</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Information about the use of the element\">Flags</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the element can appear in the instance\">Card.</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"; width: 100px\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Reference to the type of the element\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Additional information about the element\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSECGAlgorithm-definitions.html#EHDSECGAlgorithm\" title=\"An algorithm that produces ECG derived results, with the performance of this version of the algorithm.\">EHDSECGAlgorithm</a><a name=\"EHDSECGAlgorithm\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\">EHDSDevice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">ECG algorithm model<br/><br/>Elements defined in Ancestors:<a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Identifier of the device instance\">instanceIdentifier</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Unique Device Identifier (UDI) value\">udi</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Name of device manufacturer. If the manufacturer code is included in an identifier, manufacturer must correspond to that code.\">manufacturer</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"The date and time when the device was manufactured\">manufactureDate</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"The date and time beyond which this device is no longer valid or should not be used (if applicable)\">expiryDate</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Lot number of device. May be omitted if included in an identifier.\">lotNumber</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Serial number assigned by the manufacturer. May be omitted if included in an identifier.\">serialNumber</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"The name and name type of the device.\">name</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"The manufacturer's model number for the device\">modelNumber</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"The actual design of the device and/or software version running on the device\">version</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Device type\">type</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" title=\"Device note and/or comment\">note</a><br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Instances of this type can be the target of a Reference</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSECGAlgorithm.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSECGAlgorithm-definitions.html#EHDSECGAlgorithm.udi\">udi</a><a name=\"EHDSECGAlgorithm.udi\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"